</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
BCM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
B1519: Air Flow Control Actuator Position Sensor Circuit High
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Signal voltage of position sensor in air flow control actuator is higher than specified value (4.9 V) for specified time continuously.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
